plus2 — csTimer cube renderer (simulator mode)
==============================================

The simulator-mode cube renderer in this directory is derived from csTimer:

    csTimer — Professional Speedcubing/Training Timer
    Copyright (C) Shuang Chen (cs0x7f) and contributors
    https://github.com/cs0x7f/cstimer
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)

Files in this directory:

  threemin.js   — verbatim from csTimer (bundled THREE.js subset w/ CanvasRenderer)
  pnltri.js     — verbatim from csTimer (PNLTRI polygon triangulation)
  twistynnn.js  — verbatim from csTimer (NxN cube twisty plugin; twisty.js by
                  Lucas Garron & Jeremy Fleischman)
  twisty.js     — MODIFIED from csTimer: removed the jQuery dependency, the
                  csTimer touch-input table, and the `kernel` coupling
                  (config now comes from the CSTCFG shim in cube-glue.js).
  cube-glue.js  — plus2-authored glue (globals shim, WCA move parsing, solve
                  detection, factory). Also licensed GPL-3.0.

